cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BOP-Hub: a knowledge base of Beneficial Outcome Pathways"
message: "If you use BOP-Hub, please cite it as below."
abstract: >-
  A community-curated knowledge base of beneficial outcome pathways: causal
  chains linking a beneficial exposure or intervention, through measurable key
  events, to a benefit to health. The beneficial counterpart to AOP-Wiki, using
  the same event and relationship grammar so that beneficial and adverse
  pathways can be read together.
type: dataset
